Cell["\<\
Modified in 2026 by Waqas Ahmad (Fujian Institute of Research on the \
Structure of Matter, Chinese Academy of Sciences). This notebook is a \
modified version of RealisticTandem.nb by M. H. Futscher and B. Ehrler \
(https://github.com/HybridSolarCells/Tandem-Solar-Cell-Model). Changes: the \
silicon and perovskite subcells were replaced by a heterojunction \
interdigitated back-contact (HIBC) silicon cell and a TCAD-optimized \
quasi-interdigitated back-contact (QIBC) perovskite cell, and a \
three-terminal (3T) tandem model and the export of J-V curves and performance \
tables were added. The modified version is distributed under the same license.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ba2084f4-c837-0f47-ae25-77a5211bdbcc"],

